WEBVTT

1
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.166
Before this,

2
00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:10.875
Lord Krishna, answering Arjuna's
 doubts, explained

3
00:01:10.875 --> 00:01:13.583
that control over the mind is definitely difficult,

4
00:01:13.583 --> 00:01:15.958
but it's not impossible.

5
00:01:15.958 --> 00:01:16.791
Along with this,

6
00:01:16.791 --> 00:01:19.458
to gain this control, he told him

7
00:01:19.458 --> 00:01:22.125
to do continuous practice and stay away

8
00:01:22.125 --> 00:01:25.416
from things that create obstacles in yoga.

9
00:01:25.416 --> 00:01:27.416
But Arjuna's doubt

10
00:01:27.416 --> 00:01:29.500
has not ended yet.

11
00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:32.666
In the next three verses, Arjuna asks

12
00:01:32.666 --> 00:01:35.000
that if someone started walking
 on the path of yoga

13
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.250
but couldn't

14
00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:39.166
complete this journey,

15
00:01:39.166 --> 00:01:40.458
then what will be their fate?

16
00:01:45.958 --> 00:01:47.291
Arjuna accepts

17
00:01:47.291 --> 00:01:49.875
that the path of yoga is extremely difficult,

18
00:01:49.875 --> 00:01:52.500
and for this very reason, there's
 also this doubt in his mind

19
00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:54.416
that there will be many yogis

20
00:01:54.416 --> 00:01:57.500
who won't be able to complete this journey.

21
00:01:57.500 --> 00:01:59.208
In the thirty-seventh

22
00:01:59.208 --> 00:02:02.750
verse of the sixth chapter, 
Arjuna asks: O Krishna!

23
00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:05.250
What will be the condition
 of that unsuccessful yogi

24
00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:09.250
who started walking on the
 path of yoga with faith,

25
00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:11.916
but due to turbulent and disturbed mind,

26
00:02:11.916 --> 00:02:15.083
couldn't attain perfection in yoga?

27
00:02:15.083 --> 00:02:17.083
Then in the thirty-eighth verse,

28
00:02:17.083 --> 00:02:18.208
Arjuna presents his concern

29
00:02:18.208 --> 00:02:20.750
by giving a simile:

30
00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:21.833
He says

31
00:02:21.833 --> 00:02:22.750
that the yogi who

32
00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:25.666
left this path in the middle

33
00:02:25.666 --> 00:02:26.958
will neither remain

34
00:02:26.958 --> 00:02:30.916
of the material world nor of the spiritual world.

35
00:02:30.916 --> 00:02:32.708
As if they are

36
00:02:32.708 --> 00:02:34.541
a broken cloud hanging between spirituality

37
00:02:34.541 --> 00:02:36.583
and materialism.

38
00:02:36.583 --> 00:02:38.208
Such an insignificant cloud,

39
00:02:38.208 --> 00:02:40.208
which, separated from some group of clouds,

40
00:02:40.208 --> 00:02:41.666
is now

41
00:02:41.666 --> 00:02:44.541
just aimlessly

42
00:02:44.541 --> 00:02:46.666
wandering in the sky.

43
00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:49.375
This cloud has fallen alone.

44
00:02:49.375 --> 00:02:51.291
Neither is it capable of raining,

45
00:02:51.291 --> 00:02:55.125
nor does it have the cooperation of other clouds.

46
00:02:55.125 --> 00:02:58.166
Arjuna calls this state "apratișțhaħ" –

47
00:02:58.166 --> 00:03:01.083
meaning one who has no solid foundation.

48
00:03:01.083 --> 00:03:02.625
Because according to Arjuna,

49
00:03:02.625 --> 00:03:04.958
in the life of an unsuccessful yogi, neither

50
00:03:04.958 --> 00:03:08.291
the foundation of materialism
 remains, nor of spirituality.

51
00:03:08.291 --> 00:03:10.500
According to him, like a broken cloud,

52
00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:11.708
such a yogi too,

53
00:03:11.708 --> 00:03:12.958
wandering

54
00:03:12.958 --> 00:03:16.000
aimlessly, will ultimately be destroyed.

55
00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:18.791
And then in the next, meaning thirty-ninth verse,

56
00:03:18.791 --> 00:03:21.416
Arjuna appears very distressed,

57
00:03:21.416 --> 00:03:24.875
he prays to Krishna: Krishna,

58
00:03:24.875 --> 00:03:28.125
please resolve these doubts of mine.

59
00:03:28.125 --> 00:03:30.791
Other than you, there's no one else

60
00:03:30.791 --> 00:03:34.791
who can remove all these doubts of mine.

61
00:03:34.791 --> 00:03:38.125
Arjuna knows that only Lord Krishna is one

62
00:03:38.125 --> 00:03:40.708
who knows the past of this world,

63
00:03:40.708 --> 00:03:43.541
and also the present and future.

64
00:03:43.541 --> 00:03:44.875
And with this very faith, Arjuna

65
00:03:44.875 --> 00:03:49.166
is pleading for help before Lord Krishna.

66
00:03:49.166 --> 00:03:50.750
In these verses, Arjuna's concern

67
00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:54.250
somewhere also reflects our fear –

68
00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:55.041
because in everyone's

69
00:03:55.041 --> 00:03:57.458
life such situations come

70
00:03:57.458 --> 00:04:00.291
when we make many sacrifices to do

71
00:04:00.291 --> 00:04:01.791
some purposeful work,

72
00:04:01.791 --> 00:04:02.875
but in the middle of the path,

73
00:04:02.875 --> 00:04:06.458
this fear troubles us that if
 the purpose doesn't succeed,

74
00:04:06.458 --> 00:04:09.208
then all those sacrifices will remain useless.

75
00:04:09.208 --> 00:04:11.708
Neither pleasure received, nor success.

76
00:04:11.708 --> 00:04:13.708
In such a case, many questions trouble.

77
00:04:13.708 --> 00:04:15.000
Was it appropriate to abandon the purpose

78
00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:17.958
of success and remain absorbed in pleasure,

79
00:04:17.958 --> 00:04:21.333
or will it be right to abandon pleasure

80
00:04:21.333 --> 00:04:23.791
and again go after success?

81
00:04:23.791 --> 00:04:24.625
But

82
00:04:24.625 --> 00:04:25.375
here Arjuna

83
00:04:25.375 --> 00:04:27.750
is also making us believe this –

84
00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:28.583
that Paramātmā

85
00:04:28.583 --> 00:04:29.458
Lord Krishna

86
00:04:29.458 --> 00:04:33.125
will help us cross even all such situations.

87
00:04:37.625 --> 00:04:39.416
Arjuna 

88
00:04:39.416 --> 00:04:45.083
is once again expressing his doubt.

89
00:04:45.083 --> 00:04:46.625
He has many doubts

90
00:04:46.625 --> 00:04:48.666
about controlling the mind

91
00:04:48.666 --> 00:04:54.791
and the journey of yoga.

92
00:04:54.791 --> 00:04:58.666
He is asking question after question.

93
00:04:58.666 --> 00:05:05.583
And I am pleased hearing all this.

94
00:05:05.583 --> 00:05:08.791
Because Arjuna's questions,

95
00:05:08.791 --> 00:05:10.416
his turmoil,

96
00:05:10.416 --> 00:05:14.291
this prayer of his for guidance –

97
00:05:14.291 --> 00:05:16.708
all this shows

98
00:05:16.708 --> 00:05:22.208
that he is serious about yoga.

99
00:05:22.208 --> 00:05:26.375
He wants to remove all his doubts,

100
00:05:26.375 --> 00:05:31.875
wants to understand this path deeply,

101
00:05:31.875 --> 00:05:34.375
so that with complete surrender,

102
00:05:34.375 --> 00:05:37.791
he can attain the purpose of yoga.

103
00:05:37.791 --> 00:05:40.416
This purpose of his

104
00:05:40.416 --> 00:05:44.000
is born from inner inspiration.

105
00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:46.666
Some purposes are born from

106
00:05:46.666 --> 00:05:49.791
inner inspiration like this,

107
00:05:49.791 --> 00:05:53.541
but some purposes arise 
only from external influence

108
00:05:53.541 --> 00:05:56.208
or imitation.

109
00:05:56.208 --> 00:05:57.958
For example,

110
00:05:57.958 --> 00:06:01.583
if you want to become a writer,

111
00:06:01.583 --> 00:06:05.750
and this desire has come from within you,

112
00:06:05.750 --> 00:06:10.000
then you'll ask questions, improve yourself,

113
00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:13.583
search for solutions to problems.

114
00:06:13.583 --> 00:06:18.000
But if this desire has awakened
 only due to material success

115
00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:22.000
or imitating others,

116
00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:22.750
then in the mind

117
00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:26.750
there will be more fear than questions.

118
00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:29.750
Instead of changing yourself,

119
00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:33.916
you’ll waste time competing with others,

120
00:06:33.916 --> 00:06:37.750
you'll become discouraged quickly.

121
00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:39.166
Arjuna,

122
00:06:39.166 --> 00:06:42.000
even while being a great warrior,

123
00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:45.833
is not hesitating to ask for guidance.

124
00:06:45.833 --> 00:06:50.250
He wants to change himself at any cost.

125
00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:55.833
All this is only because of his inner inspiration.

126
00:06:55.833 --> 00:06:59.166
Inspiration born from external glitter

127
00:06:59.166 --> 00:07:01.666
breaks quickly.

128
00:07:01.666 --> 00:07:06.208
But inspiration that is born from within,

129
00:07:06.208 --> 00:07:10.375
its flame keeps burning, doesn't extinguish.

130
00:07:10.375 --> 00:07:12.416
Therefore,

131
00:07:12.416 --> 00:07:16.208
keep asking yourself –

132
00:07:16.208 --> 00:07:18.291
is your goal

133
00:07:18.291 --> 00:07:21.083
born from inner inspiration?

134
00:07:21.083 --> 00:07:26.000
If yes, then you'll make every possible effort,

135
00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:29.250
bring every change within yourself

136
00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:33.625
that's necessary for achieving the goal.

137
00:07:33.625 --> 00:07:35.750
And yes,

138
00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:39.000
in every hour of difficulty,

139
00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:41.416
you will also get my guidance

140
00:07:41.416 --> 00:07:44.833
just like Arjuna.

141
00:07:49.166 --> 00:07:51.208
Many times people do adopt spiritual life

142
00:07:51.208 --> 00:07:55.208
with great enthusiasm,

143
00:07:55.208 --> 00:07:58.458
but after some time, the uncontrolled mind

144
00:07:58.458 --> 00:08:01.750
distracts them from the path.

145
00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:06.458
Complete spiritual success isn't achieved, but

146
00:08:06.458 --> 00:08:09.333
now the mind doesn't engage
 in materialism either.

147
00:08:09.333 --> 00:08:11.916
Can't understand what's right,

148
00:08:11.916 --> 00:08:14.333
neither does materialism seem right,

149
00:08:14.333 --> 00:08:17.541
nor is spiritual progress achieved.

150
00:08:17.541 --> 00:08:20.625
From this very in-between state,

151
00:08:20.625 --> 00:08:25.666
restlessness and frustration arise.

152
00:08:25.666 --> 00:08:28.916
A person starts doubting their own capabilities.

153
00:08:28.916 --> 00:08:31.791
A person starts doubting their own capabilities.

154
00:08:31.791 --> 00:08:33.250
Arjuna too

155
00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:35.333
is troubled by such concern about a yogi –

156
00:08:35.333 --> 00:08:38.333
is troubled by such concern about a yogi –

157
00:08:38.333 --> 00:08:43.250
that one who is such a half-complete yogi,

158
00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:45.125
what will happen to them?

159
00:08:45.125 --> 00:08:46.791
But

160
00:08:46.791 --> 00:08:49.833
the main thing here is

161
00:08:49.833 --> 00:08:54.625
that even after all these dilemmas,

162
00:08:54.625 --> 00:08:56.541
he has complete faith in me.

163
00:08:56.541 --> 00:09:00.208
he has complete faith in me.

164
00:09:00.208 --> 00:09:02.541
Arjuna may have doubt about himself,

165
00:09:02.541 --> 00:09:04.500
may have

166
00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:08.291
skepticism about yoga succeeding,

167
00:09:08.291 --> 00:09:11.166
but

168
00:09:11.166 --> 00:09:12.791
there's not even a bit of disbelief toward me.

169
00:09:12.791 --> 00:09:16.375
there's not even a bit of disbelief toward me.

170
00:09:16.375 --> 00:09:21.208
This is an important lesson –

171
00:09:21.208 --> 00:09:26.208
in life, sometimes having doubts is natural,

172
00:09:26.208 --> 00:09:28.500
but this doubt should never be

173
00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:31.791
toward one's well-wishing guru

174
00:09:31.791 --> 00:09:36.416
or guide.

175
00:09:36.416 --> 00:09:37.750
If there's disbelief

176
00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:41.041
in the one showing the path,

177
00:09:41.041 --> 00:09:44.541
then progress is impossible.

178
00:09:44.541 --> 00:09:48.541
Doubting the guru is just like

179
00:09:48.541 --> 00:09:50.041
a patient

180
00:09:50.041 --> 00:09:54.291
doubting their only doctor

181
00:09:54.291 --> 00:09:57.375
and leaving treatment incomplete.

182
00:09:57.375 --> 00:09:58.916
Definitely express your doubt

183
00:09:58.916 --> 00:10:01.916
before the guru,

184
00:10:01.916 --> 00:10:03.291
ask questions,

185
00:10:03.291 --> 00:10:07.708
but with humility and devotion.

186
00:10:07.708 --> 00:10:11.666
Because awareness of the right direction

187
00:10:11.666 --> 00:10:14.250
will only happen when the guru's teaching

188
00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:17.375
is accepted with faith.

189
00:10:21.833 --> 00:10:24.000
In professional settings,

190
00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:26.458
for the success of some plan,

191
00:10:26.458 --> 00:10:29.500
only enthusiasm is not enough.

192
00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:31.416
Along with that enthusiasm,

193
00:10:31.416 --> 00:10:34.416
you must also think

194
00:10:34.416 --> 00:10:37.875
what problems may come on the path ahead.

195
00:10:37.875 --> 00:10:40.708
This awareness is necessary.

196
00:10:40.708 --> 00:10:43.208
From this, either you'll get the solution

197
00:10:43.208 --> 00:10:45.583
in the beginning, or at least

198
00:10:45.583 --> 00:10:51.208
when the problem comes, you won't panic.

199
00:10:51.208 --> 00:10:52.583
Arjuna too is asking about

200
00:10:52.583 --> 00:10:53.833
such a future possibility –

201
00:10:53.833 --> 00:10:57.875
such a future possibility –

202
00:10:57.875 --> 00:11:00.875
that if the yogi stopped in the middle

203
00:11:00.875 --> 00:11:04.541
of the spiritual path,

204
00:11:04.541 --> 00:11:06.041
then what will happen?

205
00:11:06.041 --> 00:11:07.375
Similarly,

206
00:11:07.375 --> 00:11:11.291
when you're moving toward some goal,

207
00:11:11.291 --> 00:11:15.083
don't just remain dependent on enthusiasm.

208
00:11:15.083 --> 00:11:17.500
Also think what challenges

209
00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:21.333
may come on the path.

210
00:11:21.333 --> 00:11:25.375
In every project, many difficulties will come,

211
00:11:25.375 --> 00:11:28.625
sometimes lack of time will arise,

212
00:11:28.625 --> 00:11:32.416
sometimes of money, sometimes something else.

213
00:11:32.416 --> 00:11:35.875
As much as possible, keep considering

214
00:11:35.875 --> 00:11:38.666
all these problems in your plan.

215
00:11:38.666 --> 00:11:41.666
If there are some questions related to this,

216
00:11:41.666 --> 00:11:43.958
then definitely discuss with some

217
00:11:43.958 --> 00:11:47.541
experienced guide, so that
 when the problem comes,

218
00:11:47.541 --> 00:11:52.250
you also know the measures to deal with it.

219
00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:53.250
A wise person

220
00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:57.416
considers all possibilities

221
00:11:57.416 --> 00:12:01.625
and prepares according to that.

222
00:12:01.625 --> 00:12:05.250
And one who is already prepared

223
00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:09.958
doesn't panic in times of trouble.
